{"id":"548bdfc76eba3ecb","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-lem-silver-lemma.md","title":"Silver's Lemma","display":"lem-silver-lemma — Silver's Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-silver-lemma","aliases":["58-lem-silver-lemma"],"display":"lem-silver-lemma — Silver's Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-silver-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-silver-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-silver-lemma — Silver's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (候选奇异基数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}\\)</span> (奇异基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (共尾数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}silver\\text{-}lemma} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&gt;\\omega\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\n\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\\bigr)\n\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}silver\\text{-}lemma} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&gt;\\omega\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\n\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\\bigr)\n\\to2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver 定理的该逆否形式要求奇异基数具有不可数共尾度；原文件漏掉了这一关键假设。</li>\n<li>This revolutionized the study of the singular cardinal hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer